#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0330 expect=violation domain=VS
#note "Lowercase columns with vstest declared before vstestcd, contradicting the SDTM Model order for VS (VSTESTCD before VSTEST). CG0330 -> the dataset order is not an ordered subset of the Model order and the rule fires once for the dataset; the reported dataset order keeps the dataset's own spelling."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-3
#library model-column-order VS STUDYID DOMAIN USUBJID VSSEQ VSGRPID VSTESTCD VSTEST VSCAT VSPOS VSORRES VSORRESU
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset VS label="Vital Signs"
col studyid  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col domain   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col usubjid  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col vsseq    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col vstest   type=Char label="Vital Signs Test Name"
col vstestcd type=Char label="Vital Signs Test Short Name"
col vsorres  type=Char label="Result or Finding in Original Units"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | VS | 01-701-1015 | 1 | Systolic Blood Pressure | SYSBP | 120
